{
  "name": "Daily gold and silver price to Google Sheets (MetalCharts API)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily gold and silver price to Google Sheets\n\nAppends one row a day with the gold and silver spot price, their 24-hour change and the gold/silver ratio.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Get a free MetalCharts API key at https://metalcharts.org/metals-api\n2. In **Get gold and silver prices**, create a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer mc_live_...` (your key).\n3. Make a Google Sheet with these headers in row 1:\n`date, gold_usd_oz, gold_change_pct, silver_usd_oz, silver_change_pct, gold_silver_ratio`\n4. In **Append row**, connect Google and pick the sheet and tab.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\nOne request a day, about 31 a month, so it fits the free plan (200 a month). A public sheet on the free plan needs a \"Metal prices by MetalCharts\" link to https://metalcharts.org.\n\nFor euros per gram, add query parameters `currency=EUR` and `unit=g` to the HTTP Request and rename the columns.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "40a0ff09-6daa-56ff-af7a-c4f737dd09ea",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 21
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "baec0acf-d03e-5238-ad31-352d6d9bbd03",
      "name": "Every day at 21:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.metalcharts.org/v1/prices",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "symbols",
              "value": "XAU,XAG"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "183a3458-f5e2-560b-86c6-b5dcb302fa04",
      "name": "Get gold and silver prices",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "0fa00827-d89c-5baa-9c25-8a7235c8b014",
              "name": "date",
              "value": "={{ $json.timestamp.slice(0, 10) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "9c4705bd-cb62-5b68-929b-84ed5e67b2dc",
              "name": "gold_usd_oz",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.XAU.price }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "9e571d7c-f732-5d99-90a4-78898954e9f1",
              "name": "gold_change_pct",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.XAU.changePercent24h }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b876426f-a729-5d4e-b942-a32e288885cd",
              "name": "silver_usd_oz",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.XAG.price }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "640be860-ed86-509a-8bc2-4cc00d1874f1",
              "name": "silver_change_pct",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.XAG.changePercent24h }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "19f4df99-d434-58e8-9f3b-10c3fd7e45a2",
              "name": "gold_silver_ratio",
              "value": "={{ Math.round($json.data.XAU.price / $json.data.XAG.price * 100) / 100 }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9c6bce88-bb50-5b10-b63e-1b191a588683",
      "name": "Shape the row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
